# Technical Fundamentals - Component Diagram Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "System Boundary"
        A[Component A] --> B[Component B]
        B --> C[Component C]
        C --> D[Component D]
    end
    
    E[External System] --> A
    D --> F[Database]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style B fill:#e1f5fe
    style C fill:#e1f5fe
    style D fill:#e1f5fe
```

## Usage
Replace component names and connections based on your system architecture.